(2713,1,'2023-06-02 21:26:03','2023-06-02 21:26:03','<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"menu_home\">\n\n  <a class=\"menu_active\" href=\"\">\n    INICIO\n  </a>\n \n  <a href=\"\">\n    NOSOTROS\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"\">\n    PRODUCTOS\n  </a>\n \n  <a href=\"\">\n    CONTACTO\n  </a>\n \n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"section_a\">\n  <div class=\"sa_block_1\">\n\n    <div class=\"sa_carousel_home\">\n      <div class=\"sa_reel\">\n\n        <div class=\"sa_item\">\n            <video class=\"video_1\" width=\"100%\" autoplay muted loop>\n              <source src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Perro-Cover.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n            </video>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sa_item\">\n            <video class=\"video_1\" width=\"100%\" autoplay muted loop>\n              <source src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Fish-Tank.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n            </video>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sa_item\">\n          <img src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/photo-1444579084407-edbadf1d3795.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sa_black_screen\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"sab1_info_container\">\n      <div class=\"sab1_img_container\">\n        <img src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/logo_green_white-e1685736789208.png\" alt=\"SUCCESS Suministros Sustentables\"/>\n      </div>\n      <p>Somos una empresa Mexicana ecológicamente responsable. Ofrecemos la solución nutritiva mas saludable y sustentable para la industria pecuaria.<br><br><br><i><b>\"La excelencia es nuestro estilo de Vida\"</b></i></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sa_block_2\">\n\n    <div class=\"sab2_info_container\">\n      <div class=\"sab2_title_container\">\n        <img src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/sprout_spot.pn