roducción (Caraveo, 2010).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto\">\n      <img\n        src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/red-chickens-eating-feed-scaled.webp\"\n        alt=\"Portafolio\"\n        style=\"width: 50%\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"group\">\n        <img src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/eggs-cups-burlap-with-dry-grass.webp\" alt=\"Portafolio\" style=\"max-width: 30%; margin-bottom: 10px;\"/>\n        <img src=\"https://suministrossustentables.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/indoors-chicken-farm-chicken-feeding-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Portafolio\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Eum pariatur asperiores labore nisi laudantium iste explicabo provident facere vel mollitia libero sequi placeat sapiente numquam, dicta rem omnis odit voluptate. Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Eum pariatur asperiores labore nisi laudantium iste explicabo provident facere vel mollitia libero sequi placeat sapiente numquam, dicta rem omnis odit voluptate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Eum pariatur asperiores labore nisi laudantium iste explicabo provident facere vel mollitia libero sequi placeat sapiente numquam, dicta rem omnis odit voluptate. Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Eum pariatur asperiores labore nisi laudantium iste explicabo provident facere vel mollitia libero sequi placeat sapiente numquam, dicta rem omnis odit voluptate. Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Eum pariatur asperiores labore nisi laudantium iste explicabo provident facere vel mollitia libero sequi placeat sapiente numquam, dicta rem omnis odit voluptate. Lorem ipsu